<title>HUNGARY: Hungary Feb PPI up 2.1 pct mo/mo,up 22.5 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Hungary Feb PPI up 2.1 pct mo/mo,up 22.5 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian producer prices in February rose 2.1 percent from January and were 22.5 percent above February 1996, the Central Statistical Office (KSH) said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>  PRODUCER PRICES		Feb 97     Jan 97     Feb 96</p>
<p> Monhtly change (pct)	    +2.1	+4.7	+1.8</p>
<p> Year-on-year change (pct)    +22.5     +22.2     +24.6</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
